Shane

Trapping web data are analysed as point transect data in Distance.  Description of input of trapping web data is on the Google group list from 2015, harking back to postings from 2006

https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/distance-sampling/trapping$20web%7Csort:relevance/distance-sampling/YIrRB7GECME/dPh3PNMhzkMJ

Trapping webs have fallen out of favour and have largely been superseded by spatial capture-recapture methods.  However, as you are performing removal trapping, this is not an option for you, as spatial capture-recapture methods require recapture data.

